Dear {!Core_IPS_Map_Par_Line_Item__c.CreatedBy},

Your Product Access Request (PAR) Line Item has been updated.


PAR Submitter:{!Core_IPS_Map_Par_Line_Item__c.CreatedBy}
PAR Number: {!Core_IPS_Map_Par_Line_Item__c.Core_MAP_PAR__c}
PAR Line Item #: {!Core_IPS_Map_Par_Line_Item__c.Name}
Line Item Approval Status: {!Core_IPS_Map_Par_Line_Item__c.Core_Line_Item_Approval_Status__c}
Account: {!Core_IPS_Map_Par_Line_Item__c.Core_Account__c}
Product: {!Core_IPS_Map_Par_Line_Item__c.Core_Supported_Product_Name__c}
Approval Support Org: {!Core_IPS_Map_Par_Line_Item__c.Core_Support_Org_Name__c}
Approver: {!Core_IPS_Map_Par_Line_Item__c.Core_LI_Approver__c}
Approval Comment: {!ApprovalRequest.Comments}


To review this Product Access Request Line Item please go to the following link: 
{!$Label.Core_IPS_Notification_Internal_URL}/{!Core_IPS_Map_Par_Line_Item__c.Id}


NOTE: If you submitted a Product Access Request with multiple Line Items you will receive one email for each Line Item when the Line Item is approved or rejected.


